### 1. Health & Readiness
GET http://127.0.0.1:4100/healthz
Accept: application/json

### 2. School Booking Rules (ADR-005 Dynamic Target T)
GET http://127.0.0.1:4100/api/v1/schools/haut/booking-rules
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create Triple-Schedule Reservation Plan (T=12:10 -> Precheck 11:40, FinalCheck 12:05, Fire 12:10)
POST http://127.0.0.1:4100/api/v1/reservation-plans
Authorization: Bearer <cloud_access_token>
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: plan_20261103_1210_demo01

{
  "school_binding_id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
  "execution_mode": "CLOUD_HOSTED",
  "target_local_date": "2026-11-03",
  "target_local_time": "12:10:00",
  "time_zone": "Asia/Shanghai",
  "consent_id": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
  "preferred_area_ids": ["area-haut-north-4f"],
  "preferred_seat_ids": ["N4-088", "N4-089"],
  "allow_alternative_seat": true,
  "precheck_lead_seconds": 1800,
  "final_check_lead_seconds": 300,
  "max_lateness_seconds": 0
}

### 4. Parcel Hub Manual/SMS Import (OTP Filtered)
POST http://127.0.0.1:4100/api/v1/parcels/imports
Authorization: Bearer <cloud_access_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campus_profile_id": "profile-haut-default",
  "source_type": "SMS_OR_NOTIFICATION_TEXT",
  "raw_content": "【菜鸟驿站】您的顺丰包裹SF152839481920已到莲花街校区东区菜鸟驿站，请凭取件码12-3-4506取件。",
  "carrier_code": "SF",
  "tracking_number": "SF152839481920"
}

### 5. Invoke Sandboxed Plugin Command (Zero Host Code Change)
POST http://127.0.0.1:4100/api/v1/plugins/org.example.hello-campus/commands/campus.demo.read/invoke
Authorization: Bearer <cloud_access_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campus_profile_id": "profile-haut-default",
  "school_id": "haut",
  "input": {
    "campus": "lianhuajie"
  }
}
